# Topic 11 — Expense Tracker

## Objective

Create a practical Excel expense tracker and analyze spending using Excel formulas and functions.

## Skills Practiced

- Data entry
- Excel Tables
- Date formatting
- Currency formatting
- SUM
- AVERAGE
- MAX
- MIN
- COUNT
- SUMIF
- INDEX
- MATCH
- Basic business analysis

## Dataset

The dataset contains personal-style expense records with:

- Date
- Category
- Description
- Payment Method
- Amount
- Month

## Analysis Performed

The workbook calculates:

- Total Expenses
- Average Expense
- Highest Expense
- Lowest Expense
- Number of Expenses
- Category-wise Expenses
- Payment-method Expenses
- Most Expensive Category

## Key Learning

Excel functions can be combined to transform raw expense data into useful business insights.

## Workbook

`Pinterest_Expense_Tracker.xlsx`